%% Secuencia de inferencia en vivo (simulador)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Usuario
    participant Web as Web (React)
    participant API as API (FastAPI)
    participant Feat as multiscore.features
    participant Mgeo as Modelo geo
    participant Mfull as Modelo full

    Usuario->>Web: arrastra tirador/defensores en la cancha
    Web->>Web: debounce 200ms
    Web->>API: POST /predict {shooter, freeze_frame}
    API->>Feat: geo_features_from_row(shot)
    API->>Feat: defender_features_from_freeze_frame(shooter, freeze_frame)
    Feat-->>API: variables geométricas + defensivas
    API->>Mgeo: predict_proba(features_geo)
    Mgeo-->>API: xg_geo
    API->>Mfull: predict_proba(features_full)
    Mfull-->>API: xg_full
    API-->>Web: {xg_geo, xg_full, xg_diff, computed_features}
    Web-->>Usuario: actualiza panel de xG en tiempo real
